   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "532f3ab",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "heading",
     "settings": {
      "title": "How it works",
      "header_size": "p",
      "_css_classes": "gt-eyebrow"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "3cc2d0b",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "heading",
     "settings": {
      "title": "Finding a therapist, without the part where you guess.",
      "header_size": "h1",
      "_css_classes": "gt-h1"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "698d5c7",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>To find a therapist in the UK: search a directory where the therapist's registration has been checked, read a few profiles, contact one or two directly, and treat the first session as a conversation rather than a commitment. Ask about cost in your first message. If it is not right, you are allowed to not go back and try somebody else.</p>",
      "_css_classes": "gt-answer"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ],
   "isInner": false
  },
  {
   "id": "683536c",
   "elType": "container",
   "settings": {
    "content_width": "boxed",
    "flex_direction": "column",
    "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-section--flush-top",
    "flex_gap": {
     "column": "20",
     "row": "20",
     "unit": "px",
     "size": 20
    }
   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "a5ee874",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<ol class=\"steps steps--4\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0\">\n<li class=\"step reveal\" data-stagger=\"1\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">01</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Search</h2><p class=\"step__body\">By town, by what you want help with, or online only. Filters narrow the list. Nothing ranks it, and there are no reviews.</p></li>\n<li class=\"step reveal\" data-stagger=\"2\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">02</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Read two or three profiles</h2><p class=\"step__body\">Each therapist answers four questions in their own words, explains how they work in plain English, and lists what was checked.</p></li>\n<li class=\"step reveal\" data-stagger=\"3\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">03</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Get in touch directly</h2><p class=\"step__body\">You write to or call the therapist. Say what you are looking for in a sentence, and ask about cost and availability. Many offer a short call first.</p></li>\n<li class=\"step reveal\" data-stagger=\"4\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">04</p><h2 class=\"h3\">Have a first session, then decide</h2><p class=\"step__body\">The first session is for finding out whether you can talk to this person. You do not have to decide anything in the room.</p></li>\n</ol>"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
