    {
     "id": "fb78c8d",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "heading",
     "settings": {
      "title": "More questions people ask",
      "header_size": "h2",
      "_css_classes": "gt-h2"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "475eb46",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "accordion",
     "settings": {
      "tabs": [
       {
        "_id": "5f08b79",
        "tab_title": "What is the difference between a counsellor and a psychotherapist?",
        "tab_content": "<p>In the UK the titles overlap and neither is protected by law, which is why the register matters more than the word. Both are checked here against their professional register. A profile explains the therapist's approach in plain English, and you can ask them how they describe the difference.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "affd2b4",
        "tab_title": "Can I have therapy online?",
        "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Many therapists listed here work by video or phone, with identical verification. <a href=\"/online-counselling/\">What changes when the room is a screen</a>.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "9c12a4b",
        "tab_title": "What does verified mean here?",
        "tab_content": "<p>A person has checked the therapist's register entry, seen a current insurance certificate, confirmed their supervision with the supervisor, and matched their identity to the register. It is repeated every year and it differs by role. <a href=\"/how-we-verify/\">How we verify</a>.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_id": "0062983",
        "tab_title": "What if I need help now?",
        "tab_content": "<p>Gototherapy is not an emergency service. If you or someone else is in immediate danger, call 999. Otherwise see <a href=\"/crisis/\">urgent support</a>.</p>"
       }
      ],
